One-Page Quick Tips — Day-Of Coordinator & Party Notes

1. Assign a single point of vendor contact (name + phone) and give that person a printed copy.
2. Place one emergency kit (clearly labeled) in the getting-ready room and tell everyone where it is.
3. Confirm arrival windows the morning before with a single group text — keep confirmations short.
4. Use PNG pages for quick sharing: send the role’s PNG in the morning rather than a long message.
5. Keep an extra printed set at the venue manager’s desk in case of lost phones.
6. Mark who carries the rings and marriage license the night before.

Design tip: Print in high-contrast mode for readability under low light at the venue.